{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bv1jh4","slideIndex":0,"text":"Results are from the joint five-fold experiment using SG smoothing and recent five-frame velocity estimation. The lowest trial-level MAE is 4.3219 mm. Velocity comparison uses the same 43,051 valid test frames across 600 trials. Follow the stated sequence of system verification, evaluation on additional participants, and future prosthetic-hand integration."}